# The Supabase CLI substitutes config.toml env() values from a plain `.env` at
# the repo root, and nowhere else — so that file holds real provider secrets
# (Google OAuth client secret) and must never be committed. This pattern matches
# only ".env" exactly, so the committed .env.example template is unaffected.
.env

